      "description": "Illustrative panel sample of the native black note card with hierarchy and a separate footer. Its text is example content.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-note-panel\" aria-label=\"Example annotation\"><header class=\"ds-note-header\"><span class=\"ds-note-number\">1</span><div><strong class=\"ds-note-title\">Selected element</strong><span class=\"ds-note-role\">Text</span></div></header><p class=\"ds-note-context\">Captured component context appears here.</p><footer class=\"ds-note-footer\"><button class=\"ds-cancel\">Cancel</button><button class=\"ds-add\">Add note</button></footer></section>",
